## Features
- Create a charming winter display;
- Enjoy warm, dynamic lighting with 8 modes;
- Fire-retardant tips and flocking for added safety;
- 2-section trunks and manual expansion;
- Slim pencil trees fit neatly into small spaces;

## Information
Bring a snowy forest atmosphere indoors or outdoors with this HOMCOM 3-piece pre-lit pencil Christmas tree set (90/120/150 cm). Great as a set or placed separately, each tree features realistic PVC tips (130/180/250 tips) with snowy flocking. Pre-strung with warm white LEDs (50/100/150 lights), it offers 8 lighting modes via an IP44 waterproof battery box. Made with pet-friendly, flame-retardant materials, these slim trees offer a safe display.
